      "text": "Classical X25519 available on TLS 1.3 control probe\nThe forced classical control probe negotiated X25519. This demonstrates the server still accepts pure classical key exchange when offered, which provides no protection against harvest-now-decrypt-later. A separate hybrid finding may also be present if the server prefers X25519MLKEM768 when both groups are offered."
